rooms_desc ({"As you walk in, you are instantly struck by the immensity of the main hallway of Tinman's Castle. There is a main aisle, carpeted in red velvet.The aisle is lined by row after row of platinum suits of armour.Decorating the gray stone walls are tapestries depicting Tinman's gloryin battle and his charity with others. There is a stair leading up, and the hallway continues northward with doors on either side.","The hallway continues... There are doors on either side, and a door on the end of the hall leading outside to the garden.","This is where the Concierge, Tinman's main housekeeper, stays. He is outat the moment, probably yelling at one of the servants.  There is a bed near the left side of the room and various other kinds of furnitures veryprofessionally placed.","This room is where Tinman stores an arsenal of weapons and armours.Spears, swords, and other various weaponry line the walls of this room.In the center of this room stands an alter to the God of War, Mars.Store your weapons here for safe-keeping.","This room equiped with everything a guest might need to make his or her staya heavenly one.  There is a four post bed with silk bedding near the centerof this room......Enjoy your stay.","This is a large garden lushed with many different exotic plants and herbs for Tinman's magical use.  Not only are these plants useful, however...They are also extremely beautiful.  You find that you cannot take youreyes off these plants.  There is also a beautiful fish pond with a gazebo it where Tinman can sit and have a relaxing meal or just watch the fish and admire his plants.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"A medieval grand hallway of Tinman's Castle","Hallway of Tinman's Castle","Concierge's chambers","Weapon storage room","Guest's room","Garden","A brand new room, ready to be decorated",0,0,0,})
