items ({({"suits","You are awe-strucked by the beauty of the blue-green armours.","tapestries","It carries the crest of Tinman....A Golden Axe","wall","Huge stone rocks make up these walls.",}),0,0,({"alter","A Golden Axe used by the God of War is kept here.","spears ","Spears from all over Holy mission are lining the walls.","Sword","Many swords of famous heros are here.....is that the Excalibur laying there.","weaponry","Hammers, axes, lances, and all kinds of other weapons......",}),0,({}),0,0,0,0,})
